# Copy this file to .dev.vars and fill in your values.
# .dev.vars is git-ignored and must never be committed.

# Authorizes worker's calls to this Worker's /send route — must match
# worker's own MAILER_INTERNAL_KEY. This is the only secret this Worker
# holds — it carries no SMTP credentials of its own; every /send request
# carries the full connection details for whichever org's config resolved
# on worker's side (see worker/src/organizations/smtp-credentials.ts).
MAILER_INTERNAL_KEY=change-me-to-a-long-random-value
